      "rationale": "The June 25, 2026 restaurant-issued allergen guide and the current restaurant-linked Dupont ordering menu are both authoritative current sources and each makes affirmative product-level Contains disclosures. Their differing positive sets affect ten products, not nine. Neither source expressly negates the allergens omitted by the other, so no omission supports an absence claim. The binding conservative resolution is therefore to retain the union of all direct positives for each affected product while preserving each source record and the guide's removable/non-removable detail. This resolves the publication conflict without inventing negative or item-level cross-contact claims."
